Board Resolution No. [Insert Number]
Resolution to Approve Acquisition of CloudTech Solutions Inc.

WHEREAS, the Board of Directors of [Insert Company Name] has conducted a thorough review of the due diligence report pertaining to the acquisition of CloudTech Solutions Inc.;

WHEREAS, the Board believes that the acquisition of CloudTech Solutions Inc. for an amount of $15 million is in the best interest of [Insert Company Name] and its shareholders;

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED that the Board of Directors of [Insert Company Name] hereby approves the acquisition of CloudTech Solutions Inc. for the sum of $15 million;

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that the Chief Executive Officer (CEO) of [Insert Company Name] is hereby authorized and directed to execute all necessary documents and take all actions necessary to consummate the acquisition of CloudTech Solutions Inc.;

BE IT FINALLY RESOLVED that this resolution shall be effective immediately upon its adoption and approval by the Board of Directors of [Insert Company Name].

ADOPTED this [Insert Date] day of [Insert Month], [Insert Year].

[Insert Board Chair's Name]
Chairperson, Board of Directors
[Insert Company Name]

